  "classes": {
    "codegen": "The same behavior, spelled so 1.9.8's compiler (C2 9044) emits its code: statement order, locals, frame packing, helpers",
    "tu-context": "Earlier functions of the original translation unit, copied in for 1.9.8's compiler, which reuses what it learned compiling them",
    "float-order": "1.9.8's float operand order, association or precision; 1.9.8 runs use 1.9.93's arithmetic, as unguarded shared code differs too",
    "nan": "A comparison spelled so that only a NaN operand takes the other path",
    "layout": "1.9.8's record, enum and interface layouts; runs keep 1.9.93's, whose extra fields 1.9.8 code leaves alone (edition 03 caps the projectile pool)",
